It does NOT cover:

  * src/, include/, assets/, Makefile, tools/, rsp/, ld/, and the other
    files inherited from the GoldenEye 007 decompilation
    (https://github.com/n64decomp/007). The upstream project is published
    without an explicit license; those files are included here on the same
    basis, unmodified except where a PC-port ABI fix is marked `#ifdef PORT`
    and documented in docs/dev/findings.md. This repository is a downstream
    fork of that decompilation with a PC port added on top.

    As is standard for console decompilation projects, some game data is
    present as re-expressed source (animation tables, display lists, data
    tables) inherited verbatim from the upstream repository. The bulk game
    assets -- textures, audio, models, level geometry, in-game text -- are
    NOT included and are extracted from your own ROM at build time.

NO NINTENDO / RARE CONTENT IS DISTRIBUTED HERE
---------------------------------------------

This repository contains NO copyrighted ROM data, game assets (textures,
models, levels, audio, text), or Nintendo/Rare code. Building a playable
executable requires a GoldenEye 007 Nintendo 64 ROM that you legally own;
the build extracts the required assets from that ROM on your own machine.

